# Route: guide 51 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 60 to
# 60, 28 quests, 2.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tirisfal Glades, Durotar, Thousand Needles, Thunder Bluff, Western
# Plaguelands, Azshara, Moonglade, Swamp of Sorrows, Burning Steppes): The
# Bulwark -> The Writhing Haunt -> The Bulwark -> Thunder Ridge -> Freewind
# Post -> Darkcloud Pinnacle -> Freewind Post -> Splithoof Crag -> near
# Thunder Bluff -> Thunder Bluff -> Ravencrest Monument -> Moonglade ->
# Thunder Bluff -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Arikara (5088; Arikara 28).
#
# Left out: Gahrron's Withering Cauldron (5227): the route takes them here but
# cannot finish them (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family Fortune (5341), The
# Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), Crest of
# Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288), Gahz'rilla (2770), Leaders of
# the Fang (914), Compendium of the Fallen (1049), A Vengeful Fate (1102),
# Testing an Enemy's Strength (5723), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher
# (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466),
# Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Oculus
# Illusions (6569), Dark Iron Legacy (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024),
# Precarious Predicament (4121), The Heart of the Mountain (4123), Egg
# Freezing (4734), Egg Collection (4735).

